{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想同時掌握購物清單、家中存貨與每月開支，又不想把生活資料上傳雲端，《Home Manager》正好切合需要。這款 App 以本機儲存為核心，毋須註冊帳戶，不含廣告與訂閱，離線亦可使用；適閤家庭、情侶、室友，或任何希望把「買了什麼、花了多少、忍住了幾次衝動消費」集中記錄的人。現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-118.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線管理清單存貨與開支</h2>\n<p>購物清單可為每項物品設定數量與單位，存貨不足時一鍵補貨，購物後勾選完成便自動回補存貨，並可撤銷。存貨記錄到期日與最低存量，可自選提前 3、7、14 或 30 天提示。記帳提供分類預算、月度統計與帳單確認，另設儲蓄罐、家務待辦、筆記與每日總結提醒；資料只存於本機，離線可用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-571-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-572-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-573-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-574-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-575-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Home Manager: Shopping List</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/home-manager-shopping-list/id6799619926?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:57.400611+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:40:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T06:38:48.392965+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:31.619648+00:00","content_hash":"af72d4d1b3d848ec40a4c6a8c03b186d00cda0fe48e53af1544a43f8c969bec2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}